{"id":"en_ethan-cole-s-rise-from-deliveryman-to-heir","title":"Ethan Cole's Rise: From Deliveryman to Heir","titleEn":"Ethan Cole's Rise: From Deliveryman to Heir","description":"A twenty-year feud rooted in family inheritance drives this story, which shows the unscrupulous lengths people will go to for personal gain while insisting that social respect and a meaningful life come only through the right path. Ethan Cole, a humble deliveryman, is drawn by accident into a high-society struggle as he tries to save his sister. Rather than turning shallow amid his changed material circumstances, he acts out of gratitude to Seraphina Ye and a wish to advance his own interests, waging a different kind of war against Arthur Ye, the man who destroyed the entire Ye family. In the end he draws on professional knowledge he thought he would never need and stages a comeback, building an image of himself as grateful and positive.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/ethan-coles-rise-from-deliveryman-to-heir/en_US/e34db6d32d7c0298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/ethan-coles-rise-from-deliveryman-to-heir/en_US/e34db6d32d7c0298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Business War","Avenge","Self-growth","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d4b4u/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_ethan-cole-s-rise-from-deliveryman-to-heir_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d4b4u/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_ethan-cole-s-rise-from-deliveryman-to-heir_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d4b4u/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_ethan-cole-s-rise-from-deliveryman-to-heir_3","title":"Episode 